Zero point energy                ...      0.26850970 Eh     168.49 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00983031 Eh       6.17 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
